The [[Eggscalibur]] is a neutral [[Weapon]] normally obtained by combining a [[Pan]] with a [[Heroic Potion]]. It uses less stamina than the [[Pan]], but deals about twice the damage, with the only drawback being the larger size, although this comes along with an extra socket and more accompanying {{icon/star}} slots. It has the same +1 damage per {{icon/star}} [[Food]] ability as the [[Pan]], but with three more {{icon/star}} slots raising the maximum possible bonus to +10 from the [[Pan]]'s +7.

Aside from these advantages, the [[Eggscalibur]] can also spend a chunk of {{icon/mana}} to trigger all the {{icon/star}} [[Food]]s, which will of course be more powerful with more numerous and higher quality [[Food]]s. Casually using just a couple of [[Blueberries]] probably isn't enough to reach this 11 {{icon/mana}} threshold, especially since they explicitly can't generate {{icon/mana}} above 10. A more dedicated {{icon/mana}} generation apparatus, like one or more [[Mana Orb]]s, may be important to get the most out of [[Eggscalibur]].
== Trivia ==
It is a nod to the mythical King Arthur's sword, [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Excalibur Excalibur].

